PTX tear+red.v2.sys+diff-cluster
"A .sys vector red.add (v2.f32) and a vector atom.add that reads both elements: can it see one element updated and not the other?"
{
x=0;
y=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                     | P1@cta 1,cluster 1,gpu 0                              ;
 red.relaxed.sys.global.v2.f32.add x, y, 1, 1 | atom.relaxed.sys.global.v2.f32.add r0, r1, x, y, 0, 0 ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
